  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2102.19 Qualified ADS contractor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2102.19 “Qualified ADS contractor” means:\n\n(a) A licensed ADS contractor; or\n\n(b) For the performance of license-exempt work that is not undertaken by a licensed ADS contractor, the qualified individual who is in charge of a project at an asbestos disposal site.\n\nSource. #12605, eff 9-1-18",
